{"path":"io/basic_fstream/open","title":"std::basic_fstream<CharT,Traits>::open","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_fstream&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>open","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_fstream/open","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Opens and associates the file with name filename with the file stream.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> open<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> filename,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><span class=\"kw1688\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">openmode</span></span></a> mode<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><span class=\"kw1691\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">in</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy3\">|</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><span class=\"kw1692\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">out</span></span></a> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> open<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">filesystem</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">path</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">value_type</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> filename,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><span class=\"kw1688\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">openmode</span></span></a> mode<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><span class=\"kw1691\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">in</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy3\">|</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><span class=\"kw1692\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">out</span></span></a> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> open<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> filename,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><span class=\"kw1688\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">openmode</span></span></a> mode<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><span class=\"kw1691\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">in</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy3\">|</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><span class=\"kw1692\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">out</span></span></a> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\" id=\"Version_4\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> open<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/path\"><span class=\"kw2219\">std::<span class=\"me2\">filesystem</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">path</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> filename,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><span class=\"kw1688\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">openmode</span></span></a> mode<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><span class=\"kw1691\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">in</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy3\">|</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><span class=\"kw1692\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">out</span></span></a> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (4) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Opens and associates the file with name <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">filename</span></code> with the file stream.\n</p><p>Calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">clear<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> on success. Calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">setstate<span class=\"br0\">(</span>failbit<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> on failure.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1,2)</span> Effectively calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rdbuf<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>open<span class=\"br0\">(</span>filename, mode<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> (see <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/open\">std::basic_filebuf::open</a></span> for the details on the effects of that call). <span class=\"t-rev-inl t-since-cxx17\"><span>Overload <span class=\"t-v\">(2)</span> is only provided if <code>std::filesystem::path::value_type</code> is not <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span>.</span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3,4)</span> Effectively calls <span class=\"t-v\">(1,2)</span> as if by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">open<span class=\"br0\">(</span>filename.<span class=\"me1\">c_str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, mode<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>. </div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> filename\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the name of the file to be opened\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> mode\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> specifies stream open mode. It is a <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/BitmaskType\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">BitmaskType</em></a>, the following constants are defined:\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Constant\n</td>\n<td> Explanation\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><code>app</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> seek to the end of stream before each write\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><code>binary</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> open in <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/FILE#Binary_and_text_modes\">binary mode</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><code>in</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> open for reading\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><code>out</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> open for writing\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><code>trunc</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> discard the contents of the stream when opening\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><code>ate</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> seek to the end of stream immediately after open\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><code>noreplace</code></a> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span>\n</td>\n<td> open in exclusive mode\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;fstream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> filename <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"example.123\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_fstream\"><span class=\"kw1751\">std::<span class=\"me2\">fstream</span></span></a> fs<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    fs.<span class=\"me1\">open</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>filename<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span>fs.<span class=\"me1\">is_open</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        fs.<span class=\"me1\">clear</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        fs.<span class=\"me1\">open</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>filename, std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">ios</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">out</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// create file</span>\n        fs.<span class=\"me1\">close</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        fs.<span class=\"me1\">open</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>filename<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/boolalpha\"><span class=\"kw1781\">std::<span class=\"me2\">boolalpha</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"fs.is_open() = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> fs.<span class=\"me1\">is_open</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"fs.good() = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> fs.<span class=\"me1\">good</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue22\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 22</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td>it was unclear how error state changes upon a successful open\n</td>\n<td>the error state is unchanged\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue409\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 409</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td>the error state was unchanged upon a successful open\n</td>\n<td>it is cleared<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\">[1]</a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue460\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 460</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td>the default argument of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">mode</span></code> in overload <span class=\"t-v\">(1)</span><br>was missing (it is present in the <a href=\"/w/cpp/header/fstream\">synopsis</a>)\n</td>\n<td>added\n</td></tr></table>\n<ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">The resolution of LWG issue #22 is overriden.</span>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_fstream/is_open\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>is_open</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks if the stream has an associated file <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_fstream/close\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>close</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  closes the associated file <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/open\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>open</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  opens a file and configures it as the associated character sequence <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_filebuf&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_fstream","title":"std::basic_fstream"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_fstream<CharT,Traits>::open","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"4 declarations; revisions: since C++11, since C++17. Opens and associates the file with name filename with the file stream."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"filename, mode","children":[{"label":"app","note":"seek to the end of stream before each write"},{"label":"binary","note":"open in binary mode"},{"label":"in","note":"open for reading"},{"label":"out","note":"open for writing"},{"label":"trunc","note":"discard the contents of the stream when opening"},{"label":"ate","note":"seek to the end of stream immediately after open"},{"label":"noreplace (C++23)","note":"open in exclusive mode"}]},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"is_open","note":"checks if the stream has an associated file"},{"label":"close","note":"closes the associated file"},{"label":"open","note":"opens a file and configures it as the associated character sequence"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++17","C++23"],"wordCount":368,"codeBlockCount":1}
